The {{Zone|lava springs}} is a section of the {{Zone|dwarven mines}} located near {{Zone|the forge}}. To get there, climb up the lava falling into the {{Zone|forge basin}}, to a large lava channel. The area can also be accessed by turning right at the start of the {{Zone|palace bridge}}.

There is a possibility to get a [[Commissions|commission]] to mine {{Item|Titanium|amount=10}} in this area. There is also a possibility to get a commission to mine {{Item|Mithril|amount=350}} Ore in this area.

